# Product Branch Folder Layout

Backend uses a **single top-level layout** — no `models/product/`, `routes/product/`, or `tests/product/` subfolders (Phase 3 flatten done).

## Backend

| Area | Path |
|------|------|
| Models | `backend/models/` (`user.py`, `stock.py`; `order.py` until Phase 2 cleanup) |
| Schemas | `backend/schemas/` (`user.py`, `stock.py`, `order.py` until Phase 2 cleanup) |
| Routes | `backend/routes/` (platform: `auth`, `security`, `health`, `deployment`) |
| Modules | `backend/modules/{inventory,orders,analytics}/` (domain HTTP; thin routes) |
| Dependencies | `backend/dependencies/` (`auth.py` PG owner; `repositories.py`; `mongo_auth.py` until Phase 2 cleanup) |
| Repositories | `backend/repositories/postgres/` (`StockRepository`; tenant-scoped) |
| Services | `backend/services/` (`stock_queries.py`, `stock_summary_service.py`, …) |
| Tests | `backend/tests/test_*.py`; legacy orders under `backend/tests/mongo/` until Phase 2 |

```text
backend/tests/
  conftest.py           # PG fixtures, owner clients, skip_startup_postgres_ping
  test_stock_api.py     # stock API
  test_auth.py          # owner auth
  mongo/                # legacy orders tests (Phase 2 delete)
    conftest.py
    test_orders_api.py
```

## Roles in tests

| Area | Roles |
|------|-------|
| `tests/test_*.py` (PG) | `owner` only |
| `tests/mongo/` (legacy) | `admin`, `user`, `guest` until Phase 2 |

## Avoid

- Reintroducing `*/product/` subfolders
- Non-`owner` roles in PG tests
- Non-stock inventory domain names in new code

See `product-branch-cleanup.mdc` for Phase 2 (remove legacy orders + mongo leftovers).
